# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Sprint 13 — Flutter (apps/client)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Fichiers générés localement par `flutter pub get` (ne pas versionner)
.dart_tool/
.flutter-plugins
.flutter-plugins-dependencies
.packages
.pub-cache/
.pub/
coverage/

# Sorties de build natives
**/android/.gradle/
**/android/local.properties
**/android/key.properties
**/android/app/.cxx/
*.jks
*.keystore
**/ios/Pods/
**/ios/.symlinks/
**/ios/Flutter/ephemeral/
**/ios/Flutter/Generated.xcconfig
**/ios/Flutter/flutter_export_environment.sh
**/macos/Pods/
**/macos/Flutter/ephemeral/
**/windows/flutter/ephemeral/
**/linux/flutter/ephemeral/
xcuserdata/

# Exceptions : les règles Visual Studio ci-dessus ([Dd]ebug*/, [Rr]elease*/)
# masqueraient des fichiers Flutter indispensables.
!apps/client/android/app/src/debug/
!apps/client/android/app/src/release/

# Exceptions : les lockfiles npm garantissent des builds reproductibles
# (`npm ci` en CI et dans les Dockerfiles).
!apps/api/package-lock.json
!apps/ai-engine/package-lock.json

# Novembre 2026 — configuration de compilation Android (identifiants réels)
apps/client/config/*.json
!apps/client/config/*.example.json
